attachment, full-frame clipping, and macOS restacking are GPUI Box work and are
not represented as imported Zed source.
The renderer-backed linear, elliptical radial, and conic gradient primitives
for up to eight ordered stops, including their Metal, Direct3D, WGPU, and
WebGL shaders, are GPUI Box work and import no additional source.
The composited sprite-batch ABI, atlas source rectangles, transforms, masks,
tint modes, and normal/additive/screen pipeline states across those renderers
are GPUI Box work and import no additional source or visual assets.
The deterministic CPU particle sampler, bounded emitter API, procedural
alpha-mask atlas, and policy-owned Kit recipes are GPUI Box work and import no
additional source, shader, or visual assets.
Normalized path-stroke trimming and wrapping dash offsets are GPUI Box work
over the existing Lyon measurement and tessellation dependency and import no
additional source.
The read-only selectable-text primitive, bidi range geometry, pointer capture,
clipboard behavior, and AccessKit text-run publication are GPUI Box work and
import no editor or product source. Rounded shaped-text backgrounds added with
that primitive are GPUI Box work as well.
The AVFoundation and Media Foundation playback services are GPUI Box work and
use operating-system frameworks; they import no additional third-party source
